{"seq":11,"slug":"deviance-and-crime","title":"越轨与犯罪","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"越轨与犯罪社会学\">越轨与犯罪社会学</h1><p>为什么有人会违反社会的规则——撒谎、偷窃、吸毒、犯罪？是因为他们天生是&quot;坏人&quot;，还是另有缘由？为什么同样的行为，在一个社会、一个时代是越轨，在另一个却被视为正常？为什么社会要惩罚越轨者，惩罚又意味着什么？越轨与犯罪，看似是关于&quot;坏人&quot;和&quot;坏事&quot;的个人道德问题，但社会学却揭示出：它们深刻地是社会的现象——由社会所界定（涂尔干说&quot;圣徒社会&quot;里最微小的过失也成重罪）、由社会条件所塑造（默顿的紧张理论）、并被社会所应对（福柯的规训权力）。越轨社会学，正是以社会学的眼光研究违反社会规范之行为的领域。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对社会、公正与人性感兴趣的读者，<strong>无需社会学背景</strong>。它以一条思想家谱系为骨架，系统讲解越轨与犯罪从界定、成因到控制的核心知识：涂尔干（失范、惩罚的功能）、默顿（紧张理论）、贝克尔与莱默特（标签）、萨瑟兰（差异交往、白领犯罪）、赫希（社会控制）、福柯（规训与惩罚）、亚历山大（大规模监禁）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>越轨与犯罪社会学是 <a href=\"../\">社会学（19_sociology）</a> 集合的一个<strong>应用专题</strong>。它与同集合的兄弟 hub 分工如下，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>在何处展开</th>\n<th>本 hub 如何引用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>涂尔干、冲突论、符号互动论、福柯的<strong>一般理论</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../sociological-theory/\">1_sociological-theory</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲它们在越轨问题上的<strong>应用</strong>，理论母体交叉链接过去</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贫困、阶级、种族、性别<strong>不平等本身</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../social-stratification/\">3_social-stratification</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲不平等与犯罪的<strong>关联</strong>，不平等的测量与机制链接过去</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>城市生态、社区<strong>本身</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../urban-sociology/\">9_urban-sociology</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲社会解组与犯罪，城市理论链接过去</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刑法、宪法<strong>法律制度</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../../law-legal/\">20_law-legal</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲正式控制的社会学意义，制度细节链接过去</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>兄弟 hub 讲&quot;是什么&quot;，本 hub 讲&quot;它如何塑造越轨与犯罪&quot;。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构与学习路径\">章节结构与学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 按越轨社会学的三大核心问题——界定、成因、应对——展开，建议顺序学习：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[第1章 基础: 越轨是社会现象] --&gt; B[第2章 界定: 相对性·建构·权力]&#10;  B --&gt; C[第3章 成因理论: 紧张·标签学习·控制]&#10;  C --&gt; D[第4章 犯罪与社会: 成因·不平等·统计]&#10;  D --&gt; E[第5章 控制与意义: 控制·惩罚·反思·总结]\">flowchart LR\n  A[第1章 基础: 越轨是社会现象] --&gt; B[第2章 界定: 相对性·建构·权力]\n  B --&gt; C[第3章 成因理论: 紧张·标签学习·控制]\n  C --&gt; D[第4章 犯罪与社会: 成因·不平等·统计]\n  D --&gt; E[第5章 控制与意义: 控制·惩罚·反思·总结]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 越轨社会学基础</strong>：界定越轨与犯罪、阐明&quot;把越轨作为社会现象&quot;的视角（涂尔干、米尔斯）与三大核心问题。这是全篇的方法论起点，<strong>务必先读</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 越轨的界定</strong>：剖析越轨的相对性（禁酒令、同性恋去病化）、它作为社会建构的本质（贝克尔、道德恐慌）、以及界定背后的权力（冲突论、选择性执法）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 越轨的理论</strong>：介绍解释越轨成因的三大理论传统——失范与紧张（默顿）、标签与社会学习（贝克尔/萨瑟兰）、社会控制（赫希）。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 犯罪与社会</strong>：把理论应用于犯罪——社会成因（社会解组、集体效能）、犯罪与不平等（白领犯罪）、犯罪统计的社会性（犯罪黑数）。</li>\n<li><strong>第五章 社会控制与意义</strong>：剖析社会控制的形式、惩罚的社会意义（涂尔干、退化仪式）、对现代惩罚的批判反思（福柯、大规模监禁），并总结越轨社会学的整体意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：无硬性前置，但若已了解 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/classical-theory/sociological-imagination\">社会学的想象力</a> 与 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/classical-theory/durkheim-social-facts\">涂尔干的社会事实</a>，会更易把握本 hub 的视角。读完本 hub 后，推荐回到 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/\">社会学理论 hub</a> 深化理论，或进入 <a href=\"../social-stratification/\">社会分层 hub</a> 拓展不平等维度。</p>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将获得一套理解越轨与犯罪的社会学框架，也将对&quot;坏人&quot;&quot;坏事&quot;这一常识理解多一分深刻的批判与反思。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"越轨社会学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-deviance","title":"什么是越轨与犯罪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/foundations/what-is-deviance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sociological-perspective","title":"越轨作为社会现象的视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/foundations/sociological-perspective"},{"seq":3,"slug":"core-questions","title":"核心问题与学科地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/foundations/core-questions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"defining-deviance","title":"越轨的界定","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/defining-deviance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"relativity","title":"越轨的相对性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/defining-deviance/relativity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-construction","title":"越轨作为社会建构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/defining-deviance/social-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-and-definition","title":"越轨界定背后的权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/defining-deviance/power-and-definition"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"theories-of-deviance","title":"越轨的理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/theories-of-deviance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anomie-and-strain","title":"失范与紧张理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/theories-of-deviance/anomie-and-strain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"labeling-and-learning","title":"标签理论与社会学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/theories-of-deviance/labeling-and-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"control-theory","title":"社会控制理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/theories-of-deviance/control-theory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"crime-and-society","title":"犯罪与社会","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/crime-and-society","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-causes-of-crime","title":"犯罪的社会成因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/crime-and-society/social-causes-of-crime"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crime-and-inequality","title":"犯罪与不平等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/crime-and-society/crime-and-inequality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crime-statistics","title":"犯罪统计与认识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/crime-and-society/crime-statistics"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"social-control-significance","title":"社会控制与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/social-control-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-control-forms","title":"社会控制及其形式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/social-control-significance/social-control-forms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"meaning-of-punishment","title":"惩罚的社会意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/social-control-significance/meaning-of-punishment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rethinking-punishment","title":"对惩罚的社会学反思","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/social-control-significance/rethinking-punishment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"越轨社会学的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/deviance-and-crime/social-control-significance/significance"}]}]}